--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT SHIPPED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI FleetAPIPage at web parity: a pure @Observable state
holder (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) over an injectable FleetAPIDataSource seam
whose value types mirror the web AppSettings / PollingConfig / CaptureStats / VersionInfo
1:1 (production binds the KMP settings endpoints GET /settings, GET /settings/polling-config,
GET /dev-tools/telemetry-capture/stats, GET /system/version, POST /settings/suspend-api,
PUT /settings/polling-config through the seam). The page reproduces the web PageContainer
chrome (title + subtitle) and all three top-level web GlassPanels plus their nested glass
surfaces (8 GlassPanel literals total in the web source, all reproduced):

  Tesla API Polling card (web GlassPanel #1) — the global suspend/resume switch + a status
    line, with the suspended-state red callout (web GlassPanel #2).
  API Endpoint Controls card (web GlassPanel #3) — the Polling (7) / On-Demand (11) /
    Command (2) endpoint toggle grids (each EndpointToggle is web GlassPanel #1 reused), the
    telemetry-capture block (MongoDB badge + Raw Signal Recording toggle), the Retention
    Period Select row (web GlassPanel #4), and the captured-signal count note (web GlassPanel
    #5). The "(enabled/total)" tally + per-section uppercase labels are reproduced.
  API Endpoints card (web GlassPanel #6) — the build-version line + the configured-URL list
    (each row web GlassPanel #7) or, when no endpoints are reported, the empty state.

Adaptive (ADR-002/006): the endpoint toggles flow in an adaptive LazyVGrid (multi-column on
macOS/iPad regular width, single column on iPhone compact). Every data state is implemented:
loading (redacted panel skeletons), empty (ContentUnavailableView), success (the populated
panels), plus a retryable error view (never a blank region). The suspend/endpoint/retention
mutations surface the web toasts as a dismissible HIG banner bound to model state. All copy
resolves from Localizable.xcstrings with the web key names verbatim; zero hardcoded literals.

Files (all new unless noted):
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIModels.swift            (value types / datasource seam / states / notice / fmtInt)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPageModel.swift         (@Observable model + endpoint key catalog)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPageModel.Sample.swift  (actor seed source)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPage.swift              (view: header + notice banner + states + 3 panels)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPISurfaces.swift          (shared EndpointRow + panel header + glass/tinted chrome)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPage.Polling.swift      (Tesla API Polling card + suspended callout)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPage.Endpoints.swift    (controls card + sections + endpoint catalog)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPage.Telemetry.swift    (telemetry capture + retention + capture-stats note)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPage.Configured.swift   (API Endpoints card + URL rows + empty)
  Sources/Features/Admin/FleetAPIRouteRegistration.swift (.fleetAPI route registration)
  Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/FleetAPIPageModelTests.swift (state-machine + mutation + value + route tests)
  Sources/App/AppRoute.swift            (MOD: +.fleetAPI case / pathSegment "fleet-api" / icon / .system group)
  Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift            (MOD: wire FleetAPIRouteRegistration into routeHosts)
  Localization/Localizable.xcstrings    (MOD: +71 keys incl route.fleetAPI; 70 are the parity strings)
  apps/parity/apple-ledger.json         (MOD: +2 rows page:admin/FleetAPI 81/81, apple-macos + apple-ios)

Navigation reconciliation: web /fleet-api resolves to a dedicated .fleetAPI route
(pathSegment "fleet-api", System sidebar group) — AppRouteParser.parse(path:) matches the
path segment directly (no alias needed, since the web path equals the kebab pathSegment),
mirroring the sibling .fleetTelemetryCoverage pattern. Reachable + deep-linkable without
displacing other admin pages. The generated TeslaSync.xcodeproj is git-ignored (xcodegen).

